# A reserved word in `project-rename` and as a named argument.
mode: syntax
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | project-rename false = amount | extend x = f(and = 1)
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..74
  PIPELINE@0..73
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
