error[DS0126]: `false` is a reserved word
  --> query:1:36
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | project-rename false = amount | extend x = f(and = 1)
  |                                    ^^^^^ a reserved word cannot be a name without quotes
  |
  = help: to use it as a name, quote it: `['false']`

error[DS0126]: `and` is a reserved word
  --> query:1:66
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | project-rename false = amount | extend x = f(and = 1)
  |                                                                  ^^^ a reserved word cannot be a name without quotes
  |
  = help: to use it as a name, quote it: `['and']`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from 'orders.csv' | project-rename ['false'] = amount | extend x = f(['and'] = 1)
which parses without errors
